0,2⟩=16.$ What is the value of $\\frac{a}{c}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308389 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "a973cbbd-df7e-5f41-a87c-5c205b31db4a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308389 #edb/ref 1074 "We need a vector $v=⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩$ that is parallel to the given plane. \n\nFrom the equation $r\\cdot ⟨4,0,2⟩=16$ of the plane, we get the normal vector $n=⟨4,0,2⟩.$ So, $v⊥n$ and we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩\\cdot ⟨4,0,2⟩ & =0 \\\\ 4{t}_{1}+2{t}_{3} & =0 \\\\ 2{t}_{3} & =-4{t}_{1} \\\\ {t}_{3} & =-2{t}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain \n\n$$\nv=⟨{t}_{1},\\,{t}_{2},\\,-2{t}_{1}⟩,\n$$\n\nwhere ${t}_{1},{t}_{2}\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ \n\nWe are told that the second component of $v$ equals $0.$ So, we must set ${t}_{2}=0.$ \n\nSince $v$ is nonzero, we can pick any ${t}_{1}\\ne 0.$ For example, setting ${t}_{1}=1$, we get\n\n$$\nv=⟨1,\\,0,\\,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\frac{a}{c}=-\\frac{1}{2}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308399 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186307974 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308399 #edb/ref 1069 "q-33317" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308399 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308399 #edb/ref 1071 "Find an equation of the plane that passes through the point $Q(1,-4,2)$ and is perpendicular to the line that goes through the points \n$A(2,1,-3)$ and $B(1,6,-4).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308399 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "4553242a-e32b-5422-9dd6-251f47f5a320" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308399 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we note that the position vector of $Q$ is $q=⟨1,-4,2⟩.$\n\nSince the line  passes through the points $A(2,1,-3)$ and $B(1,6,-4)$ we can find a vector parallel to the line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =⟨1,6,-4⟩-⟨2,1,-3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,5,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨-1,5,-1⟩.$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩ & =⟨1,-4,2⟩\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩ & =-23.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308412 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186308192 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308412 #edb/ref 1069 "q-33322" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308412 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308412 #edb/ref 1071 "Find an equation of the plane that contains the point  $Q(5,2,3)$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n=6i+5j+4k.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308412 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "dc9756ae-93f4-5e8e-b7df-21ca51316b9d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186308412 #edb/ref 1074 "First, notice that the position vector of $Q$ is $q=5i+2j+3k$ and $n=6i+5j+4k$ is normal to the plane. \n\nThe equation of the plane that passes though the point $Q({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n$ can be given as\n\n$$\n(r-q)\\cdot n=0,\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is the position vector of any point on the plane, and $q$ is the position vector of $Q.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot (6i+5j+4k) & =(5i+2j+3k)\\cdot (6i+5j+4k) \\\\ r\\cdot (6i+5j+4k) & =52.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336620 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336620 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336620 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3e4dafb7-c1e3-52bb-9be6-8c920a5e0c22" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336688 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{1}{5}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336688 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336688 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "46a8c73e-1b6f-5ead-8b4e-04fd47ae71ea" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336827 #edb/ref 1080 "5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336827 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336827 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "566ad7e4-2332-5818-b1ab-63f151123755" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336968 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{5}{4}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336968 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336968 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6955aab1-e2a7-5bda-a291-b54a99b1d9fb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337195 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{4}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337195 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337195 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "806b2ca4-42eb-53b0-90bb-44522d3b01e9" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
